  "description": "\"It's a preference, I'll change it, I'll change baseball!  \nI'll cater to your every whim, even your bedtime routine.\"  \nA man suddenly appeared in front of Seung-ha, Chai-en, and a contract marriage was arranged!  \nBut the man was cold, and the end was a prearranged divorce.  \n'I admit it! I was once attracted to him, but now... I want to destroy that attraction!  \n\"Divorce. We're not compatible on every level!\"  \nWhen I declared my intention to divorce him, he went straight for it!\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=5872238)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=805405), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9326149)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/newlywed-guide/list?title_no=5238), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/newlywed-guide/list?title_no=5256), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002943)",
